    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The contract",
      "items": [
        "Extension is id, title, Screen, Sidebar, tools, providers",
        "Tiny is what it gets back \u2014 and it only ever grows",
        "An extension never imports a sibling; the test fails the build"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "What a runtime module may reach",
      "items": [
        "react, react/jsx-runtime, react-router, zod, ai",
        "Nothing relative: a blob has no base to resolve against",
        "The map ships hashed inside index.html, so it can't go stale"
      ]
